      "text": "CHEMOSYNTHETIC ECOSYSTEMS         ← SUNLIGHT-INDEPENDENT LIFE\n  ┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n  │  Hydrothermal vents: H₂S oxidation → primary production  │\n  │  Cold seeps: methane as energy source                     │\n  │  Whale falls: ~30-year succession community               │\n  └───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```"
