        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nMARINE BIOLOGY\n├── Biological Oceanography   — organisms + physical ocean interaction\n├── Marine Ecology            — community structure, food webs, trophic dynamics\n├── Marine Physiology         — pressure/cold/salt adaptation mechanisms\n├── Systematic Ichthyology    — fish taxonomy and evolution\n├── Cetology                  — whales, dolphins, porpoises\n├── Marine Microbiology       — bacteria, archaea, viruses in ocean\n│   ├── Biological pump       — carbon export to deep ocean\n│   └── Microbial loop        — dissolved organic carbon cycling\n├── Deep-Sea Biology          — hadal and abyssal life\n│   ├── Hydrothermal biology  — vent chemosynthetic communities\n│   └── Cold seep biology     — methane seep communities\n├── Marine Conservation       — MPAs, fisheries, climate impacts\n└── Coral Reef Ecology        — reef ecosystems, bleaching, structure\n```"
    }
